"v1"><span begin="24.542" end="24.895">Aye,</span> <span begin="26.018" end="26.595">new</span> <span begin="26.595" end="26.727">mon</span><span begin="26.727" end="27.193">ey,</span> <span begin="27.193" end="27.369">suit</span> <span begin="27.369" end="27.866">and</span> <span begin="27.866" end="28.473">tie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">嘿 新贵的模样 穿着西装 打着领带</span></p><p begin="28.473" end="30.666" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.473" end="28.570">I</span> <span begin="28.570" end="28.973">can</span> <span begin="28.973" end="29.235">read</span> <span begin="29.235" end="29.424">you</span> <span begin="29.424" end="29.532">li</span><span begin="29.532" end="29.645">ke</span> <span begin="29.645" end="29.762">a</span> <span begin="29.762" end="30.063">ma</span><span begin="30.063" end="30.347">ga</span><span begin="30.347" end="30.666">zine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我可以像翻阅杂志一样看穿你</span></p><p begin="30.914" end="33.526" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.914" end="31.138">Ain&apos;t</span> <span begin="31.138" end="31.581">it</span> <span begin="31.581" end="31.727">fun</span><span begin="31.727" end="32.194">ny</span> <span begin="32.194" end="32.400">rum</span><span begin="32.400" end="32.872">ors</span> <span begin="32.872" end="33.526">fly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">传闻到处都是 很有趣吧</span></p><p begin="33.526" end="35.636" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.526" end="33.634">And</span> <span begin="33.634" end="33.959">I</span> <span begin="33.959" end="34.256">know</span> <span begin="34.256" end="34.571">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="34.571" end="34.888">heard</span> <span begin="34.888" end="35.056">a</span><span begin="35.056" end="35.336">bout</span> <span begin="35.336" end="35.636">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你听过我的大名</span></p><p begin="35.656" end="37.739" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.656" 